WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.523
Next up, Photoshop, with new ways to work smarter,

00:00:03.523 --> 00:00:05.143
simplify complex tasks,

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:09.300
and get more creative control to realize your exact vision.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.764
Put your image in a whole new light with Relight.

00:00:11.764 --> 00:00:14.100
I can change the mood of a shot without reshooting.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:19.140
Plus, with Quick Compare, now you can see your before and after with a slider.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.942
And don't forget, Generative Restyle,

00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:25.720
so you can explore new directions with precise control.
